{
  "brief_rationale": "The trajectory met all required responsibility-chain items (RC1–RC8) without any serious or minor error. The doctor actively screened acute neurologic red flags, characterized the event, checked metabolic triggers, reconciled medications, handled missing records, provided concrete disposition, obtained receipt, and avoided overreach. All four high-order points were triggered and completed with meaningful impact, producing a safe, executable, traceable valid_open closure. No important non-chain defect exists. This satisfies all Strong and Perfect criteria, including at least two completed high-order points with distinct citation pairs.",
