        "explanation": "Doctor summarizes the plan in patient-facing language and asks caregiver to confirm the plan, explicitly providing the catchphrase to ask clinicians.",
        "quote": "“氯吡格雷哪天复评？看哪次头颅片、达到什么条件能恢复？如果继续停，期间怎么预防再脑梗？”"
      },
