      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The doctor provided a concrete, time-bounded, barrier-aware plan with emergency thresholds, medication boundaries, and record-retrieval paths. The caregiver demonstrated understanding and confirmed ability to execute. Residual uncertainties (missing formal CT reports, incomplete event details) were explicitly acknowledged as allowed residual risks. The trajectory ends open with a safe handoff and continued responsibility.",
