        "explanation": "Doctor explicitly screens for worsening consciousness and neurological deficits, instructing immediate action.",
        "quote": "若他比刚才更困、回答变慢或叫不醒，立即按铃/喊护士，不用等查房，并直接说“意识状态较刚才变差”。"
      }
    ],
