          "quote": "就会诊已经开单了，还在等转运和CT室排，没说准几点能推走。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor corrected the false-negative interpretation of \"recovery means benign,\" explained that visible orders are not equivalent to reviewed results, and set a concrete verification path tied to triage.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
