          "quote": "现在继续严格按急诊医嘱禁食禁水，阿司匹林、氯吡格雷及其他口服药都不要自行恢复或补服。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00318",
          "explanation": "Doctor separates inpatient IV orders from discharge/home oral medications without treating all orders as current.",
          "quote": "氯吡格雷暂缓通常是在权衡再次缺血与出血风险；在复查影像和主管医生明确恢复条件前，自行加回反而可能增加危险。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor reconstructed a reliable medication timeline from incomplete caregiver statements and workspace evidence, integrated medication uncertainty into the safety plan, and converted it into a safer medication-verification workflow.",
